NOTE ON SOURCES (important)

This license covers only this project's DERIVED data (`data/derived/`) — the harmonized,
independently re-extracted panel this project's own code produces from public source documents.
It does NOT cover the underlying source documents themselves — court-monitor reports, special
master filings, neutral-expert reports, state-hospital and legislative-budget documents. Those are
third-party public records produced by their respective authors, courts, and agencies; they are
redistributed UNCHANGED under `data/raw/` solely to make the pipeline reproducible from its exact
inputs, and their rights remain with those authors, courts, and agencies. The rights basis differs
by state and document type — see `data/raw/NOTICE` (a per-state summary table) and each state's own
`data/raw/<state>/README.md` for the specific basis and per-file provenance. `SOURCES.csv` at the
archive root has the exact source URL and SHA-256 for every file.
